	)
	(text "BT1 fitted in order 1 (D10); J2 DNP (variant B).\nBT1 pads 3/4 = far-end tabs, joined: series pack.\nPad-to-cell mapping and J2 pin 1 = cell +:\nUNVERIFIED (continuity test). BT1 and J1/J2/U3\noverlap on the board on purpose (D15)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 93.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "31090fb0-26ce-591a-bd15-6880a3889446")
	)
	(text "C20 10uF: Cin (>= 5 uF effective, 6.3).\nR40/R41 1M/1M: VBAT_SENSE to P1.04 AIN0\n(4.2 V -> 2.1 V). Unswitched: 1.5 uA\n(PARTS-REVIEW 17). No filter cap:\nthe cards do not ask for one."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.38 81.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4451763b-7d57-5e11-af63-15b1b155dc84")
	)
	(text "P-FET: D to cell +,\nS to VIN, G to GND.\nBody diode D->S;\nreversed cell: off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 92.71 67.31 0)
		(effects
